    { heading: 'Check the five-star reality', body: ['Read whether the hotel is an international five-star brand, a local five-star, a heritage-value hotel, or a near-luxury exception. A local five-star can still be a lovely stay, but expectations should be calibrated.', 'Recent reviews matter more than old awards. Look for comments about maintenance, bathrooms, air conditioning, noise, breakfast, and staff consistency.'] },
